<title>UK: Abbey chief executive to stand down in 1998.</title>
<headline>Abbey chief executive to stand down in 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abbey National Plc chief executive Peter Birch said a decision on who will succeed him in the post will be announced this time next year.</p>
<p>&quot;I'll be presenting our 1997 results and then about this time next year a decision will be made about my successor,&quot; Birch said in an interview.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
